  "Specification": "This module is a collection of unit-style TLA+ operator tests focused on inlining, LET-bound operators, higher-order operators, lambda passing, nullary operators, and scoping behavior. It exercises local and global operator definitions, nested LET blocks, operator arguments passed by name, lambda expressions, and polymorphic-looking typed annotations in comments for Apalache-oriented checking. The module does not model a transition system with mutable variables or faults; although it defines trivial Init and Next operators as TRUE, the substantive content is a conjunction of test formulas asserting expected evaluation results of operator applications.",
